@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.C06_LedgerReconReportModels.C06_LedgerReconReport_SummaryModel.C06_LedgerReconReport_SummaryItem
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    string rowClass = "table-success";
    string cellClass = "text-green font-weight-bold";
    string status = "Ok";
    if (Model.Diff < 20 && Model.Diff > -20)
    {
        rowClass = "table-success";
        cellClass = "text-green font-weight-bold";
        status = "Ok";
    }
    else if (Model.CoaDiff > 20 || Model.CoaDiff < -20)
    {
        rowClass = "table-warning";
        cellClass = "text-yellow font-weight-bold";
        status = "Sync Mismatch";
    }
    else if (Model.Diff > 20 || Model.Diff < -20)
    {
        rowClass = "table-danger";
        cellClass = "text-red font-weight-bold";
        status = "Un-reconciled";
    }

}
<td scope="col">@Model.CompanyName</td>
<td scope="col" class="@Html.Raw(cellClass)">@status</td>
<td scope="col" class="text-right">@Model.CoaDiff.ToMoneyNoDecimal()</td>
<td scope="col" class="text-right">@Model.CoaTotal.ToMoneyNoDecimal()</td>
<td scope="col" class="text-right">@Model.LedgerTotal.ToMoneyNoDecimal()</td>
<td scope="col" class="text-right">@Model.ProductsTotal.ToMoneyNoDecimal()</td>
<td scope="col" class="text-right">@Model.Diff.ToMoneyNoDecimal()</td>
<td scope="col">@Model.LatestSyncDate.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>
<td scope="col">@Model.LatestSyncDate_Monthly.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>

<script>
    $(document).ready(function () {
        $('#@Model.TableRowID').attr("class", '@rowClass');
    });
</script>
